From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP teleport join queues by destination chunk

After the split, chunk 0 is not region id 0. The 0001 join was delivered
on the shard whose center is chunk 10 while the position was written at
0.5, 6.5. Commit only after this thread owns the destination chunk, and
re-queue by that chunk rather than a captured region id. Player.aiStep
skips getEntities when the pickup box is off-thread so a one-tick-late
teleport does not become "Internal server error". isInWall skips a null
getChunk (0053 cut keys). Teleport accept no longer requires the 1-chunk
halo when that neighbor is the cut. Post-applyAllPatches.
---

